----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

let a = 1000

----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

let a2 = a

----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

var w = a2

----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

let c = w + 1

----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

set w = w * 2

----------
expect all five units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `a` moved |
| 2 | takes `a` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `a2` moved |
| 3 | takes `a2` (2) | compiles, runs | new | `w` = 2000 |
| 4 | reads `w` (3) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 1001 |
| 5 | updates `w` (3) | compiles, runs | new | - |

----------
scriptunit-edit 4
----------

let c = w + 2

----------
expect unit 4 is edited
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 2 reruns and takes `a`, which it took when it last ran | `a` moved |
| 2 | takes `a` (1) | reruns | rerun: unit 3 reruns and takes `a2`, which it took when it last ran | `a2` moved |
| 3 | takes `a2` (2) | reruns | rerun: unit 4 reads `w`, which unit 5 updated after it | `w` = 2000 |
| 4 | reads `w` (3) | recompiles, runs | edited | `c` = 1002 |
| 5 | updates `w` (3) | reruns | rerun: updates `w` from unit 3, which reran | - |

